    <h1 class="legal-title">Help With A Current Reservation</h1>
    <p class="legal-intro">Need to update a payment card or ask about an active stay? Direct-booked guests should use the secure guest-portal link tied to the reservation. If you booked through Airbnb or Vrbo, keep payment changes inside that platform.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container legal-shell">
